          "snippet": {
            "line": 651,
            "text": "theorem profileRows_sub {D D' : ProfileHistories.RadialDomain}\n    (P : ProfileHistories.Profiles D) (Q : ProfileHistories.Profiles D')\n    (hp : P.pressure0 = Q.pressure0) (p : Point) :\n    profileRows P p - profileRows Q p = axisHistory P.f P.U p - axisHistory Q.f Q.U p"
